title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
tags: kpd_party

# KPD version of the base game's Fundraising card. Moscow's subsidy is not included yet (milestone M4).

= Fundraising

The party cannot exist without money, and in the inflation the dues are worth less every week.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.
- @arrears: Collect arrears district by district, as Pieck proposes.
- @easy_discard

@arrears
view-if: pieck_advisor = 1
subtitle: Pieck is in the leadership. · dev: resources +dues, resources +1
on-arrival: resources += dues; resources += 1

Pieck goes through the books and the districts, and finds money that nobody had asked for in months. The comrades grumble at being asked, and pay.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ dues +] resources gained. · dev: resources +dues
on-arrival: resources += dues;

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ dues - 1 +] resources gained. · dev: dues −1, resources +dues, kf_right_dissent −8, kf_left_dissent −8, kf_centre_dissent −8
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; resources += dues; kf_right_dissent -= 8; kf_left_dissent -= 8; kf_centre_dissent -= 8

Our members, many of them unemployed, appreciate this, but no one joins a party because of low dues.

@increase
subtitle: [+ dues + 1 +] resources gained. [? if unemployed >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?] · dev: dues +1, resources +dues, workers_kpd −3, unemployed_kpd −3, workers_kpd −3*dues (if dues >= 5), unemployed_kpd −3*dues (if dues >= 5)
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources += dues; workers_kpd -= 3; unemployed_kpd -= 3; workers_kpd -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; unemployed_kpd -= 3*dues if dues >= 5
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed leave. But now we have access to additional resources.
